### ===================================
### Online Clipboard API - Test Endpoints
### ===================================

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000

### ===================================
### ROOT - Health Check
### ===================================

### Test root endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### ===================================
### CLIPBOARD ENDPOINTS
### ===================================

### Send clipboard content (plain text)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clipboard/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "Hello, this is a test clipboard content!",
    "content_type": "text",
    "is_confidential": false
}

###

### Send confidential clipboard content (encrypted)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clipboard/send
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "This is a secret message!",
    "content_type": "text",
    "is_confidential": true,
    "encryption_key": "mysecretkey123"
}

###

### Receive clipboard content (replace CODE with actual 4-digit code)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clipboard/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "1234"
}

###

### Receive confidential clipboard content (with decryption key)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/clipboard/receive
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "code": "1234",
    "decryption_key": "mysecretkey123"
}

### ===================================
### URL SHORTENER ENDPOINTS
### ===================================

### Shorten URL (auto-generated path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "url": "https://www.google.com/search?q=hello+world"
}

###

### Shorten URL (custom path)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/urls/shorten
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "url": "https://github.com",
    "custom_path": "mygithub"
}

###

### Redirect short URL (replace SHORT_PATH with actual path)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/urls/mygithub

### ===================================
### FILE SHARING ENDPOINTS
### ===================================

### Get file info by share code (replace CODE with actual 4-digit code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/files/1234

###

### Download file by share code (replace CODE with actual 4-digit code)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/files/download/1234
